      en: ["Established in 1958 by Mennonite settlers from Mexico.", "Residents use horse and buggies for primary transportation.", "Leading producer of poultry and eggs for the Belizean market.", "The primary language spoken is Plautdietsch (Low German).", "Most homes and businesses do not use public electricity.", "Located in the Corozal District near the Progresso Lagoon."],
