      en: ["Chicago is located near Golden Stream in a biodiverse part of the Toledo District", "The population consists primarily of Mopan Maya and small Mestizo groups", "Cocoa is the community's most important commercial commodity for export", "The settlement is accessible only via unpaved roads from the Southern Highway", "The community utilizes traditional Maya land-use systems such as milpa farming", "Chicago is among the smallest registered settlements in southern Belize"],
